{"arm": "vs", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 9, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Warm editorial: cream paper, serif display type, teal and coral accents, with a subtle wave-line motif drawn in CSS and inline SVG", "probability": 0.34}, {"direction": "Swiss minimal: strict sans-serif grid, near-white background, one saturated blue accent, and generous whitespace with almost no decoration", "probability": 0.24}, {"direction": "Neo-brutalist: thick black borders, hard offset shadows, flat saturated color blocks, and oversized bold type", "probability": 0.18}, {"direction": "Dark utility: deep navy background, monospace labels, a glowing grid-based week view, and a developer-tool aesthetic", "probability": 0.14}, {"direction": "Skeuomorphic corkboard: a textured pinboard background with tilted sticky notes and pushpins that show the week as a physical planning wall", "probability": 0.1}], "pick": {"direction": "Neo-brutalist: thick black borders, hard offset shadows, flat saturated color blocks, and oversized bold type", "probability": 0.18}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Tidepool | Plan your week together</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --ink: #111111;\n    --paper: #FFF6E0;\n    --yellow: #FFE600;\n    --pink: #FF5FA2;\n    --blue: #2F6BFF;\n    --green: #00C48C;\n    --orange: #FF7A1A;\n    --white: #FFFFFF;\n    --border: 4px solid var(--ink);\n    --shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--ink);\n    --shadow-sm: 5px 5px 0 var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n  }\n\n  a { color: inherit; }\n\n  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n\n  .wrap {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 24px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 16px 26px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease;\n  }\n  .btn:hover {\n    transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);\n  }\n  .btn:active {\n    transform: translate(5px, 5px);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--ink);\n  }\n  .btn-pink { background: var(--pink); }\n  .btn-blue { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }\n  .btn-yellow { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .btn-green { background: var(--green); }\n  .btn-lg { font-size: 22px; padding: 22px 34px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */\n  .nav {\n    background: var(--white);\n    border-bottom: var(--border);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .nav .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 84px;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    background: var(--yellow);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  }\n  .nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 28px;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; }\n  .nav-links a:hover { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .nav .btn { font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 18px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .hero {\n    background: var(--yellow);\n    border-bottom: var(--border);\n    padding: 80px 0 110px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;\n    gap: 56px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--white);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\n    transform: rotate(-2deg);\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 120px);\n    line-height: 0.9;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 .hl {\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    padding: 0 12px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .hero p.lead {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n  }\n  .hero-ctas {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero-note {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  /* Board mock */\n  .board {\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--ink);\n    transform: rotate(2deg);\n  }\n  .board-head {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--white);\n    padding: 14px 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }\n  .dots span {\n    width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid var(--white);\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .dots span:nth-child(1) { background: var(--pink); }\n  .dots span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .dots span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--green); }\n  .board-cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n    border-top: 0;\n  }\n  .col {\n    border-right: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    min-height: 340px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .col:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n  .col-title {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    padding: 6px 2px;\n    background: var(--paper);\n  }\n  .card {\n    border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);\n    padding: 8px 8px 10px;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n  .card small {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .c-pink { background: var(--pink); }\n  .c-blue { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }\n  .c-green { background: var(--green); }\n  .c-orange { background: var(--orange); }\n  .c-yellow { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .c-white { background: var(--white); }\n  .board-foot {\n    border-top: var(--border);\n    background: var(--green);\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Marquee ---------- */\n  .marquee {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--white);\n    border-bottom: var(--border);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .marquee-track {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 18px 0;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    animation: slide 22s linear infinite;\n  }\n  .marquee-track span { margin-right: 40px; }\n  .marquee-track .o { color: var(--yellow); }\n  @keyframes slide {\n    from { transform: translateX(0); }\n    to { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */\n  section { padding: 110px 0; border-bottom: var(--border); }\n  .eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: var(--blue);\n    color: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 92px);\n    line-height: 0.92;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    margin-bottom: 56px;\n    max-width: 900px;\n  }\n  .section-title .under {\n    background: var(--pink);\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    border: var(--border);\n    display: inline-block;\n    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);\n  }\n\n  /* Features */\n  .features { background: var(--paper); }\n  .feature-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 36px;\n  }\n  .feature {\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    padding: 34px 28px 36px;\n    background: var(--white);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  .feature:nth-child(1) { background: var(--pink); }\n  .feature:nth-child(2) { background: var(--green); }\n  .feature:nth-child(3) { background: var(--orange); }\n  .feature-num {\n    font-size: 64px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    width: 96px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  }\n  .feature h3 {\n    font-size: 32px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .feature p {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n  /* How it works */\n  .how { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }\n  .how .section-title { color: var(--white); }\n  .how .section-title .under { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); }\n  .how .eyebrow { background: var(--ink); }\n  .steps {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 0;\n    border: var(--border);\n    background: var(--white);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  }\n  .step {\n    padding: 40px 32px 44px;\n    border-right: var(--border);\n  }\n  .step:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n  .step-n {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: var(--yellow);\n    border: var(--border);\n    font-size: 40px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .step h3 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .step p {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n  /* Stats */\n  .stats {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 28px;\n    background: var(--paper);\n  }\n  .stat {\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 28px 24px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .stat:nth-child(1) { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .stat:nth-child(2) { background: var(--pink); }\n  .stat:nth-child(3) { background: var(--green); }\n  .stat:nth-child(4) { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }\n  .stat .big {\n    font-size: 72px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .stat .label {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  /* Testimonials */\n  .quotes {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 32px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .quote {\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    padding: 32px;\n    background: var(--white);\n  }\n  .quote.big-q { background: var(--yellow); }\n  .quote blockquote {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  }\n  .quote.big-q blockquote { font-size: 38px; }\n  .quote cite {\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--white);\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .quote:nth-child(2) { transform: rotate(-1.5deg); }\n  .quote:nth-child(3) { transform: rotate(1.5deg); background: var(--paper); }\n\n  /* Pricing */\n  .pricing { background: var(--paper); }\n  .price-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 36px;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .plan {\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n    background: var(--white);\n    padding: 36px 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .plan h3 {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .plan .price {\n    font-size: 72px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .plan .price small {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n  .plan .per {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .plan ul {\n    list-style: none;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .plan li {\n    padding: 10px 0;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .plan li::before {\n    content: \"\u25a0\";\n    color: var(--pink);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .plan li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n  .plan .btn { text-align: center; }\n  .plan.hot {\n    background: var(--pink);\n    transform: translateY(-14px);\n    box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--ink);\n  }\n  .plan.hot li::before { color: var(--yellow); }\n  .ribbon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -20px;\n    right: 24px;\n    background: var(--yellow);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    transform: rotate(4deg);\n  }\n  .plan-wrap { position: relative; }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .faq-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;\n    gap: 60px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .faq-grid .section-title { margin-bottom: 0; font-size: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 76px); }\n  details {\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  details:nth-child(even) { background: var(--yellow); }\n  summary {\n    list-style: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 22px 26px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: var(--white);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  details[open] summary::after { content: \"\u2013\"; }\n  details p {\n    padding: 0 26px 24px;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    padding-top: 18px;\n  }\n\n  /* Final CTA */\n  .final {\n    background: var(--green);\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 130px 0;\n  }\n  .final h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(64px, 11vw, 160px);\n    line-height: 0.85;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: -0.04em;\n    margin-bottom: 44px;\n  }\n  .final h2 span {\n    background: var(--white);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--ink);\n    padding: 0 18px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    transform: rotate(-2deg);\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .final p {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 44px;\n  }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  footer {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--white);\n    padding: 64px 0 40px;\n  }\n  .foot-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .foot-logo {\n    font-size: 44px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    background: var(--yellow);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    border: var(--border);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  footer p.tagline {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    max-width: 320px;\n  }\n  footer h4 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--yellow);\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  footer ul { list-style: none; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; }\n  footer li { margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  footer li a { text-decoration: none; }\n  footer li a:hover { background: var(--pink); color: var(--ink); }\n  .foot-bottom {\n    margin-top: 56px;\n    padding-top: 24px;\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--white);\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n  @media (max-width: 1000px) {\n    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .board { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n    .feature-grid, .price-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .plan.hot { transform: none; }\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .step { border-right: 0; border-bottom: var(--border); }\n    .step:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n    .quotes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .quote:nth-child(2), .quote:nth-child(3) { transform: none; }\n    .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }\n    .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n    .nav-links { display: none; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    section { padding: 72px 0; }\n    .hero { padding: 56px 0 80px; }\n    .board-cols { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n    .col { min-height: auto; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }\n    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .stat .big { font-size: 56px; }\n    .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .btn-lg { font-size: 18px; padding: 18px 24px; }\n    .marquee-track { font-size: 26px; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .marquee-track { animation: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- NAV -->\n<header class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">Tidepool</a>\n    <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n      <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#how\">How it works</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"btn btn-pink\">Start free</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<main>\n<section class=\"hero\" style=\"padding-bottom:110px; border-bottom: var(--border);\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"tag\">For teams of 2 to 12</span>\n      <h1>Plan the week <span class=\"hl\">together.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Tidepool is a shared weekly board where small teams line up who's doing what, when, and why, before Monday hits.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n        <a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg btn-pink\">Start free</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">See how it works</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\" style=\"margin-top:28px;\">No credit card. Set up in under 4 minutes.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Board mock -->\n    <div class=\"board\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Preview of a Tidepool weekly board with five day columns and colored task cards\">\n      <div class=\"board-head\">\n        <span>Team Lumen \u00b7 Week 14</span>\n        <div class=\"dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"board-cols\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div class=\"col-title\">Mon</div>\n          <div class=\"card c-pink\">Kickoff sync<small>9:30 \u00b7 all</small></div>\n          <div class=\"card c-white\">Ship pricing copy<small>Dana</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div class=\"col-title\">Tue</div>\n          <div class=\"card c-blue\">Design review<small>Sam \u00b7 1h</small></div>\n          <div class=\"card c-yellow\">Fix login bug<small>Priya</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div class=\"col-title\">Wed</div>\n          <div class=\"card c-green\">Focus block<small>Lee \u00b7 no meetings</small></div>\n          <div class=\"card c-white\">Client call<small>Dana \u00b7 2pm</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div class=\"col-title\">Thu</div>\n          <div class=\"card c-orange\">Launch dry run<small>Whole team</small></div>\n          <div class=\"card c-yellow\">Write changelog<small>Sam</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div class=\"col-title\">Fri</div>\n          <div class=\"card c-pink\">Retro<small>4pm \u00b7 30m</small></div>\n          <div class=\"card c-green\">Ship it \ud83d\ude80<small>Everyone</small></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"board-foot\">\n        <span>4 of 6 done</span>\n        <span>Focus: 9h</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- MARQUEE -->\n<div class=\"marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"marquee-track\">\n    <span>Plan <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Sync <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Focus <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Ship <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Repeat <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span></span>\n    <span>Plan <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Sync <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Focus <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Ship <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span> Repeat <span class=\"o\">\u2736</span></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- FEATURES -->\n<section class=\"features\" id=\"features\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">What's inside</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three things. <span class=\"under\">Zero</span> clutter.</h2>\n    <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n      <article class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature-num\">01</div>\n        <h3>Shared week board</h3>\n        <p>One screen shows everyone's commitments for Monday through Friday. No more hunting through threads to find out who owns the launch.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature-num\">02</div>\n        <h3>Focus blocks</h3>\n        <p>Protect deep work on the calendar. Tidepool flags meeting collisions the moment they happen and suggests a better slot.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"feature\">\n        <div class=\"feature-num\">03</div>\n        <h3>Monday huddle</h3>\n        <p>A 10-minute agenda builds itself from last week's leftovers. Walk in prepared, walk out with the plan locked.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section class=\"how\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three steps. <span class=\"under\">Done</span> by lunch.</h2>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-n\">1</div>\n        <h3>Invite your crew</h3>\n        <p>Add teammates with one link. Nobody needs a tutorial, and nobody needs a second login.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-n\">2</div>\n        <h3>Drop in the work</h3>\n        <p>Type what needs doing, drag it onto a day, and tag an owner. Color codes do the rest.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-n\">3</div>\n        <h3>Lock it on Monday</h3>\n        <p>Run the huddle, confirm the plan, and let Tidepool send a single summary to everyone.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- STATS -->\n<section class=\"stats-section\" style=\"padding:100px 0; border-bottom: var(--border); background: var(--paper);\">\n  <div class=\"wrap stats\">\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"big\">4\u00d7</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">Faster weekly planning</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"big\">12</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">Max people per team</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"big\">0</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">Meetings required to start</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"big\">9h</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">Focus time protected / week</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->\n<section style=\"background: var(--white);\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Loud and honest</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Small teams. <span class=\"under\">Big</span> weeks.</h2>\n    <div class=\"quotes\">\n      <figure class=\"quote big-q\">\n        <blockquote>\"We stopped running Monday meetings that started with 'so, what is everyone doing?'\"</blockquote>\n        <cite>Dana R. \u00b7 Founder, 4 people</cite>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"quote\">\n        <blockquote>\"The focus blocks alone saved our dev team a whole day a week.\"</blockquote>\n        <cite>Priya K. \u00b7 Eng lead</cite>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"quote\">\n        <blockquote>\"It looks like a sticky-note wall and works like a grown-up tool.\"</blockquote>\n        <cite>Sam T. \u00b7 Design</cite>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- PRICING -->\n<section class=\"pricing\" id=\"pricing\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Free until it <span class=\"under\">isn't</span> small.</h2>\n    <div class=\"price-grid\">\n      <div class=\"plan\">\n        <h3>Scrappy</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">$0</div>\n        <div class=\"per\">Up to 4 people, forever</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>One shared week board</li>\n          <li>Drag-and-drop tasks</li>\n          <li>Weekly email summary</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-yellow\">Start free</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"plan hot\">\n          <h3>Crew</h3>\n          <div class=\"price\">$6<small> /person</small></div>\n          <div class=\"per\">Billed monthly \u00b7 Cancel anytime</div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Everything in Scrappy</li>\n            <li>Focus blocks + conflict alerts</li>\n            <li>Monday huddle builder</li>\n            <li>Unlimited past weeks</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-yellow\">Get Crew</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan\">\n        <h3>Tidal</h3>\n        <div class=\"price\">Let's talk</div>\n        <div class=\"per\">For 13+ people</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Everything in Crew</li>\n          <li>SSO and admin controls</li>\n          <li>Calendar sync for all seats</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Contact us</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<section id=\"faq\" style=\"background: var(--paper);\">\n  <div class=\"wrap faq-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Asked <span class=\"under\">loudly</span>.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <details open>\n        <summary>Do we need everyone on the same calendar tool?</summary>\n        <p>No. Tidepool works on its own. If you use Google or Outlook, you can optionally sync, but the board stands alone.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Can we plan across time zones?</summary>\n        <p>Yes. Each teammate sees the board in their local time, and day columns map to the team's home week.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>What happens to our data if we leave?</summary>\n        <p>Export everything as CSV or JSON from settings at any time. We delete your data within 30 days of account closure.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details>\n        <summary>Is there a mobile app?</summary>\n        <p>The web app is fully responsive and works well on phones. Native apps are on the roadmap.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2>Start your <span>week</span> right.</h2>\n    <p>Free for teams of four. Your first board takes four minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-lg btn-yellow\">Create my board</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"foot-logo\">Tidepool</a>\n        <p class=\"tagline\">A weekly planning board for small teams who would rather be doing the work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Product</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#how\">How it works</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Changelog</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Careers</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Help</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Status</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-bottom\">\n      <span>\u00a9 2025 Tidepool. Made for small crews.</span>\n      <span>Privacy \u00b7 Terms</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}